('a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002','assistant','Booked: tank water-heater install, Fri 10am–1pm with Luis at 31-15 34th St. Starts at $1,200, final quote on site. See you Friday!','Friday 10am','Booked: tank water-heater install, Fri 10am–1pm with Luis at 31-15 34th St. Starts at $1,200, final quote on site. See you Friday!','create_appointment','Confirmed slot; created appointment with qualified tech.','book','new_booking','[{"tool":"create_appointment","price":1850}]'::jsonb, now() + interval '30 seconds');
