('a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006','assistant','Booked: sump pump maintenance, Wed 1–3pm with Sam at 55 Middle Neck Rd. Good to have you back, Tom!','Yes same address, Wed 1pm','Booked: sump pump maintenance, Wed 1–3pm with Sam at 55 Middle Neck Rd. Good to have you back, Tom!','create_appointment','Confirmed; reused stored address; created appointment.','book','new_booking','[{"tool":"create_appointment","price":225}]'::jsonb, now() + interval '30 seconds');
