('a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','assistant','Updated: your drain clearing is now Fri 1–3pm with Dave at 213-10 41st Ave. See you Friday!','Friday 1pm','Updated: your drain clearing is now Fri 1–3pm with Dave at 213-10 41st Ave. See you Friday!','update_appointment#reschedule','Re-checked availability; updated the same job to the new time (no new booking).','reschedule','reschedule_cancel','[{"tool":"update_appointment","change":"reschedule"}]'::jsonb, now() + interval '30 seconds');
