-- =====================================================================
-- Seed 05 — conversations + message threads WITH eval fields.
-- Source: docs/customer-app/implementation/seed-data.md §05, eval-pipeline.md §1
-- One conversation per customer (ids d0000000-…-0000000000NN, NN=01..30).
